  "filesystem": "APFS",
  "plaintext_preview": "HIDDEN DATA HIDDEN DATA HIDDEN DATA ...",
  "notes": [
    "Each timestamp overwrite contributes 4 hidden bytes.",
    "Grouping by inode offset shows how the payload fragments are distributed.",
    "Detection requires low-level timestamp parsing and entropy/pattern checks."
